.TH RSYNBACKTUX.CONF 5 "2026" "rSynBackTux" "File Formats"
.SH NAME
rsynbacktux.conf \- configuration for rSynBackTux backups
.SH SYNOPSIS
.I /etc/rsynbacktux/backup.conf
.SH DESCRIPTION
The file is sourced by
.BR rsynbacktux\-backup (8)
and therefore uses shell syntax: one
.I NAME="value"
assignment per line, lines starting with # are comments. It is normally written
by
.BR rsynbacktux\-setup (8),
but can be edited by hand at any time; changes take effect on the next run.
.SH OPTIONS
.SS Connection
.TP
.B SYNO_HOST
Host name or IP address of the NAS. No default, mandatory.
.TP
.B SYNO_MODULE
rsync module on the NAS. Default: NetBackup.
.TP
.B SYNO_USER
rsync user. Default: backup.
.TP
.B SYNO_SUBDIR
Target subdirectory inside the module, usually the server name.
.TP
.B PASSFILE
File holding the rsync password, mode 0600. Default: /root/.rsync_pass.
.SS Backup
.TP
.B SOURCE
Source directory. Default: / (the whole root file system).
.TP
.B ONE_FILE_SYSTEM
"true" adds rsync \-x, which skips separate partitions such as /home or /var.
Default: false.
.TP
.B DELETE
"true" removes files on the target that no longer exist in the source.
Default: true.
.TP
.B PRESERVE_ACLS
"true" transfers ACLs and extended attributes. May cause trouble on the NAS.
Default: false.
.TP
.B EXCLUDE_FILE
Exclude list passed to rsync as \-\-exclude\-from, one pattern per line.
Default: /etc/rsynbacktux/excludes.list.
.TP
.B EXCLUDE_REMOTE_MOUNTS
"true" excludes NFS, CIFS and SSHFS mounts detected at run time.
Default: true.
.SS Behaviour
.TP
.B VERBOSE
"true" logs every transferred file, which makes the log grow quickly.
Default: false.
.TP
.B TOLERATE_PARTIAL
"true" treats rsync exit code 23 as a warning instead of a failure.
Default: false.
.TP
.B BANDWIDTH_LIMIT
Limit in KB/s, empty means unlimited.
.TP
.B RSYNC_TIMEOUT
I/O timeout in seconds. Default: 600.
.SS Paths
.TP
.B LOGFILE
Log file. Default: /var/log/backup\-to\-synology.log.
.TP
.B LOCKFILE
Lock file guarding against parallel runs.
Default: /var/lock/rsynbacktux.lock.
.SH EXAMPLE
.nf
.RS
SYNO_HOST=192.168.178.5
SYNO_MODULE=NetBackup
SYNO_USER=backup
SYNO_SUBDIR=webserver
SOURCE=/
DELETE="true"
BANDWIDTH_LIMIT="20000"
RSYNC_TIMEOUT="600"
.RE
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR rsynbacktux\-backup (8),
.BR rsynbacktux\-setup (8),
.BR rsync (1)
.SH AUTHOR
https://github.com/W0rkingChr1s/rSynBackTux
